  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component provides core data structures for modeling structured knowledge. The KnowledgeGraph class implements an in-memory graph using adjacency lists to manage nodes and labeled relationships, supporting operations like pathfinding (BFS) and DOT rendering. It integrates with VectorMemory, accessed via a Singleton Bridge pattern, to allow querying of structured data alongside semantic vectors."
